  "Description": "THROWAWAY SPIKE (2b) — the audio-graph root. Collects all leaf sources reachable through its input (recursively, through groups) and routes each source's tone into a root-owned BASS bus under the operator mixer, reconciling live. Master Volume on the bus. Wire Result into your render chain so it evaluates. Delete after 2b.",
